(23, NULL, 'SciTechDaily', 'Unknown Author', 'A Nearby Supernova Could Finally Solve the Dark Matter Puzzle - SciTechDaily', 'Researchers believe that observing gamma rays from a supernova could confirm the existence of axions, potentially solving the mystery of dark matter. UC Berkeley scientists suggest that the detection of these particles would revolutionize our understanding of…', 'https://scitechdaily.com/a-nearby-supernova-could-finally-solve-the-dark-matter-puzzle/', 'https://scitechdaily.com/images/Astrophysics-Supernova-Concept.jpg', '2024-11-23 15:03:50', 'Detecting axions via gamma rays from a supernova could unlock the secrets of dark matter, with UC Berkeley researchers pushing for advanced telescopes to ensure we don’t miss this fleeting opportunit… [+10866 chars]', 'science'),
