(53, NULL, 'CNN', 'Liam Reilly', 'Jeff Bezos says he will try to talk Trump out of idea that the news media is an ‘enemy’ - CNN', 'Despite feuding with Trump during his last administration, Bezos said he was “very optimistic” about a second Trump administration and suggested he even wants to help the incoming president.', 'https://www.cnn.com/2024/12/04/media/jeff-bezos-donald-trump-media-enemy/index.html', 'https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/gettyimages-2188281047.jpg?c=16x9&q=w_800,c_fill', '2024-12-05 08:54:00', 'Jeff Bezos hopes Donald Trump has changed.\r\nSpeaking at The New York Times DealBook Summit on Wednesday, the billionaire Amazon founder and Washington Post owner said he hopes that a second Trump adm… [+4142 chars]', 'Uncategorized');
