(75, 'College Football Playoff Rankings reaction: SEC love prevails again as Alabama sits ahead of Miami in top 25 - CBS Sports', 'Stop me if you\'ve heard this one before: Alabama is ranked ahead of an ACC team with fewer losses', 'https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/college-football-playoff-rankings-reaction-sec-love-prevails-again-as-alabama-sits-ahead-of-miami-in-top-25/', 'https://sportshub.cbsistatic.com/i/r/2024/11/24/fe35dd66-30bf-4b0b-908b-5bedf5bdff54/thumbnail/1200x675/0a3e0dfc3c260aa3ac123632bc36b8b3/alabamakalendeboermilroe.jpg', '2024-12-04 12:50:00', 'CBS Sports', '', 'The ACC branding issues struck again. And the SEC again got the benefit of the doubt.\r\nSame as it ever was, right?\r\nThat was the sentiment emanating from ACC Country Tuesday after the College Footbal… [+5796 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
