(6, NULL, 'Variety', 'Steven J. Horowitz', 'Sabrina Carpenter Brings Sparkle and Sarcasm — Plus Christina Aguilera — to Los Angeles Show: Concert Review - Variety', 'Sabrina Carpenter brought sparkle and sarcasm — plus Christina Aguilera — to Los Angeles on her \'Short n\' Sweet\' tour.', 'https://variety.com/2024/music/concert-reviews/sabrina-carpenter-christina-aguilera-short-n-sweet-los-angeles-concert-review-1236212219/', 'https://variety.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/GettyImages-1856295066.jpg?w=1000&h=563&crop=1', '2024-11-16 20:39:00', 'Just past the halfway mark of her first of three Los Angeles shows last night, Sabrina Carpenter cracked a Colgate smile as she arrived at evening’s roulette moment, where she spins a bottle to deter… [+4583 chars]', 'entertainment'),
(7, NULL, 'Associated Press', 'PHILIP MARCELO', 'NYC politicians call on Whoopi Goldberg to apologize for saying bakery denied order over politics - The Associated Press', 'New York City politicians are calling on Whoopi Goldberg to apologize for suggesting on air that a local bakery had declined to make The View co-host a batch of desserts for her birthday because of her political beliefs. Local leaders and supporters joined Ho…', 'https://apnews.com/article/whoopi-goldberg-staten-island-bakery-birthday-dessert-45b9f1ab9da1783eb436c3db161da19d', 'https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/d86bc45/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3696x2079+0+189/resize/1440x810!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F2f%2F29%2Fda218b37b373cb5c91e88cccb1b2%2Fa9708340bfb24ae684f8db71d967570b', '2024-11-16 18:39:00', 'NEW YORK (AP) New York City politicians are calling on Whoopi Goldberg to apologize for suggesting on air that a local bakery had declined to make The View co-host a batch of desserts for her birthda… [+3607 chars]', 'entertainment'),
(8, NULL, 'Tom\'s Guide', 'Jenna Dorsi', 'Netflix just got a new Christmas movie and it’s already jumped to No. 1 - Tom\'s Guide', 'Stream it now to learn what happens if Frosty the Snowman becomes suddenly hot', 'https://www.tomsguide.com/entertainment/netflix/netflixs-rom-com-hot-frosty-made-me-melt-dont-miss-this-christmas-movie', 'https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/JmfidiajH7Y9iEbxJDrXdg-1200-80.jpg', '2024-11-16 18:15:32', 'Netflix’s new holiday rom-com “Hot Frosty” finally answers the age-old question \"What if Frosty the Snowman was hot? Like, really hot?\"\r\nYes, Netflix’s hottestnew Christmas movie has jumped to No. 1,… [+5246 chars]', 'entertainment'),
(9, NULL, 'Deadline', 'Glenn Garner', 'Eva Longoria Clarifies She Didn’t Leave U.S. “Because Of Trump” - Deadline', 'After revealing she splits her time between Spain and Mexico City, Eva Longoria clarified that the move was because of work, not Donald Trump\'s win.', 'http://deadline.com/2024/11/eva-longoria-didnt-leave-us-because-trump-1236178773/', 'https://deadline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/GettyImages-2001752717-e1730500917503.jpg?w=1024', '2024-11-16 18:01:00', 'Although Eva Longoria has relocated outside the United States, she didn’t make her decision based on any one politician.\r\nThe Golden Globe nominee, who mostly splits her time between Spain and Mexico… [+1733 chars]', 'entertainment'),
