(12, NULL, 'Associated Press', 'BRENDAN FARRINGTON', 'Betty White Forever: New stamp will honor the much-beloved ‘Golden Girls’ actor - The Associated Press', 'The United States Postal Service might have found a way to unite a nation bitterly divided after this month’s election: It’s releasing a Betty White stamp. The beloved actor known for roles in “The Golden Girls,” “The Mary Tyler Moore Show,” “Boston Legal,” a…', 'https://apnews.com/article/betty-white-usps-entertainment-e502f94c15a0594125776f16328bec37', 'https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/82628b2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2293x1290+0+119/resize/1440x810!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F8b%2F20%2F63b513e4da2bd1d0f593e67bf165%2F1b21962515374a8abc0bb44df8780c1d', '2024-11-16 18:05:00', 'The United States Postal Service might have found a way to unite a nation bitterly divided after this months election: Its releasing a Betty White stamp.\r\nThe beloved actor known for roles in The Gol… [+1690 chars]', 'entertainment'),
(13, NULL, 'The Washington Post', 'Frances Vinall', 'South Africa denies illegal miners food and water to force them out - The Washington Post', 'Officials are blocking access to basic supplies for hundreds of people underground in a northwest mine shaft as part of a crackdown on miners.', 'https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2024/11/16/south-africa-illegal-miners-stilfontein/', 'https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-apps/imrs.php?src=https://arc-anglerfish-washpost-prod-washpost.s3.amazonaws.com/public/TMTBBFGZRGU7KZG5UPSTEBI7Y4_size-normalized.jpg&w=1440', '2024-11-16 18:29:27', 'South African authorities have been criticized over a controversial tactic to force illegal miners hiding more than a mile underground in the countrys northwest to the surface by cutting off their ac… [+5942 chars]', 'general'),
(14, NULL, 'Associated Press', 'MIKE STOBBE', 'US health officials report 1st case of new form of mpox in a traveler - The Associated Press', 'Health officials say they have confirmed the first U.S. case of a new form of mpox that was first seen in eastern Congo. Authorities said Saturday the risk to the public is low. The person had traveled to eastern Africa and was treated in California. Official…', 'https://apnews.com/article/mpox-first-us-traveler-case-6e2ee003f53b7dc1d2e33ec16ba7c628', 'https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/0049230/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2577x1450+0+134/resize/1440x810!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2Fe7%2F56%2F88fc7125036be62e9952473eedd6%2Fc484b00fc22349d3929a5a6899dba3cb', '2024-11-16 18:24:00', 'NEW YORK (AP) Health officials said Saturday they have confirmed the first U.S. case of a new form of mpox that was first seen in eastern Congo. \r\nThe person had traveled to eastern Africa and was tr… [+2559 chars]', 'general'),
(15, NULL, 'Associated Press', 'BISWAJEET BANERJEE', 'Fire engulfs hospital ward in northern India, killing 10 newborn babies - The Associated Press', 'A fire tore through a neonatal intensive care unit in a hospital in northern India, killing 10 newborn babies and injuring 16 others. The fire occurred late Friday at a hospital in Jhansi city in India’s Uttar Pradesh state. Officials said the blaze spread qu…', 'https://apnews.com/article/india-jhansi-hospital-fire-newborns-c2236ba37d12e4f5353df5ebb68171e2', 'https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/abcc843/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2016x1134+0+105/resize/1440x810!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F61%2Fae%2F5060fc0773ed5548e4a710e90d61%2Fe164bddb88454fc481800f3d5f67da53', '2024-11-16 17:50:00', 'LUCKNOW, India (AP) A fire tore through a neonatal intensive care unit in a hospital in northern India, killing 10 newborn babies and injuring 16 others, authorities said.\r\nThe fire occurred late Fri… [+2691 chars]', 'general'),
(16, NULL, 'Neurosciencenews.com', 'Neuroscience News', 'How Depression Alters Stress, Health, and Lifespan - Neuroscience News', 'Depression disrupts the body\'s stress systems, causing physical health risks like heart disease, diabetes, and stroke, and reducing life expectancy by 7-10 years.', 'https://neurosciencenews.com/depression-stress-longevity-28066/', 'https://neurosciencenews.com/files/2024/11/depression-stress-lifespan-neuroscience.jpg', '2024-11-16 19:44:22', 'Summary: Depression disrupts the body’s stress systems, causing physical health risks like heart disease, diabetes, and stroke, and reducing life expectancy by 7-10 years. The condition triggers brai… [+4164 chars]', 'health'),
