(19, NULL, 'CNN', 'Katie Hunt', 'NASA’s only visit to Uranus happened during a rare cosmic occurrence - CNN', 'This week, revisit what you know about Uranus, explore the far side of the moon, rediscover the famed fossil known as Lucy, and meet an otherworldly sea creature.', 'https://www.cnn.com/2024/11/16/science/the-only-visit-to-uranus-happened-during-a-rare-cosmic-occurrance/index.html', 'https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/c-jpegpia26069.jpg?c=16x9&q=w_800,c_fill', '2024-11-16 16:00:00', 'Editors note: A version of this story appeared in CNNs Wonder Theory science newsletter. To get it in your inbox, sign up for free here.\r\nThe answers to the biggest questions in space science what ha… [+5325 chars]', 'science'),
(20, NULL, 'Space.com', 'Tariq Malik', 'Last supermoon of 2024 wows skywatchers around the world with Full Beaver Moon (photos) - Space.com', 'The Full Beaver Moon of November 2024 put on a gorgeous show in the night sky for photographers worldwide, and we\'ve got the photos to prove it.', 'https://www.space.com/stargazing/last-supermoon-of-2024-wows-skywatchers-around-the-world-with-full-beaver-moon-photos', 'https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/d3jYiBo2WFRQBzt9oBncKd-1200-80.jpg', '2024-11-16 15:59:00', 'The final supermoon of 2024, the Beaver Moon of November, thrilled skywatchers around the world as it ushered in the weekend with a stunning night sky sight.\r\nNovember\'s full moon rose on Friday (Nov… [+6973 chars]', 'science'),
