(22, NULL, 'Futurism', 'Victor Tangermann', 'Scientist Says NASA Lander May Have Accidentally Killed Life on Mars - Yahoo! Voices', 'Astrobiologist Dirk Schulze-Makuch from the Technische Universität Berlin in Germany believes that humans may have unintentionally killed all life on Mars in...', 'https://futurism.com/scientist-nasa-lander-killed-life-mars', 'https://media.zenfs.com/en/futurism_981/0fe4a4061b39d2b417cd5bdf680781a5', '2024-11-16 15:00:33', 'Yahoo is using AI to generate takeaways from this article. This means the info may not always match what\'s in the article. Reporting mistakes helps us improve the experience.Generate Key Takeaways\r\nA… [+3148 chars]', 'science'),
(23, NULL, 'Live Science', 'Kelly Lambert', 'Neuroscientists taught rats to drive tiny cars. They took them out on \'joy rides.\' - Livescience.com', 'Scientists taught rats to drive to a certain destination, but the rodents took a detour, suggesting they enjoy both the journey and the rewarding destination.', 'https://www.livescience.com/health/neuroscience/neuroscientists-taught-rats-to-drive-tiny-cars-they-took-them-out-on-joy-rides', 'https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/TGcUSkzvo745qGbFNpve8m-1200-80.jpg', '2024-11-16 14:00:00', 'We crafted our first rodent car from a plastic cereal container. After trial and error, my colleagues and I found that rats could learn to drive forward by grasping a small wire that acted like a gas… [+9329 chars]', 'science'),
