(61, NULL, 'Goal.com', 'Charles Watts', 'Arsenal player ratings vs Nottingham Forest: Title gone? Behave! Bukayo Saka brilliance - and magic from Martin Odegaard - gets Gunners back on track - Goal.com', 'Arsenal roared back to winning ways in the Premier League with a 3-0 win over Nottingham Forest, closing the gap on leaders Liverpool - here\'s GOAL\'s player ratings', 'https://www.goal.com/en-gb/lists/arsenal-player-ratings-nottingham-forest-bukayo-saka-martin-odegaard/bltef22814c98fdbe2d', 'https://assets.goal.com/images/v3/bltbc3cc87007d5845d/GOAL%20-%20Multiple%20Images%20-%203%20Stacked%20-%20Facebook%20(2).jpg', '2024-11-23 16:59:37', 'The Gunners roared back to winning ways in the Premier League to close the gap on leaders LiverpoolArsenal ended their four-game run without a Premier League win in style as they swept Nottingham For… [+959 chars]', 'sports'),
(62, NULL, 'ATP Tour', 'Unknown Author', 'Novak Djokovic hires Andy Murray as new coach - ATP Tour', 'Novak Djokovic announced on social media Saturday that longtime friend and rival Andy Murray will be his new coach.', 'https://www.atptour.com/en/news/novak-djokovic-hires-andy-murray-as-new-coach', 'https://www.atptour.com/-/media/images/news/2024/11/23/16/32/murray-djokovic-coach.jpg', '2024-11-23 16:52:57', 'No Content', 'sports'),
(63, NULL, 'Tom\'s Guide', 'Olivia Halevy', 'Massive Best Buy Black Friday sale live — here\'s the 35 deals I\'m recommending to family and friends - Tom\'s Guide', 'The top Best Buy deals to kick start savings season', 'https://www.tomsguide.com/sales-events/massive-best-buy-black-friday-sale-heres-the-35-deals-im-shopping-this-weekend', 'https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/7FkHv9ouFkKeazRjfu5Fod-1200-80.jpg', '2024-11-23 15:47:16', 'Best Buy\'s official Black Friday sale went live this week — and the deals and doorbusters do not disappoint! From now through actual Black Friday (November 29), you can expect the latest and greatest… [+888 chars]', 'technology'),
(64, NULL, 'GameSpot', 'Cameron Koch', 'World Of Warcraft At 20 Is The Same And Increasingly Unrecognizable, And That\'s By Design - GameSpot', 'Blizzard looks back on two decades of its genre-defining MMORPG, and talks how it\'s already planning for the next 20 years.', 'https://www.gamespot.com/articles/world-of-warcraft-at-20-is-the-same-and-increasingly-unrecognizable-and-thats-by-design/1100-6527983/', 'https://www.gamespot.com/a/uploads/screen_kubrick/1585/15855271/4404233-wow_20th_anniversary_wallpaper_1920x1080.png', '2024-11-23 14:00:00', 'World of Warcraft is celebrating its 20-year anniversary today, November 23, 2024. Below, we talk with key developers about the journey to make the game what it is today, and the future ahead.\r\nTwo d… [+7152 chars]', 'technology'),
(65, NULL, 'The Verge', 'Kylie Robison, Barbara Krasnoff', 'What’s on your desk, Kylie Robison? - The Verge', 'The Verge’s senior reporter covering artificial intelligence (AI) has a workspace decorated with family photos and gaming figures.', 'https://www.theverge.com/24303127/home-office-desk-nintendo', 'https://cdn.vox-cdn.com/thumbor/TOJplhJXdCV355IHFghGHXdItqY=/0x0:4032x3024/1200x628/filters:focal(2016x1512:2017x1513)/cdn.vox-cdn.com/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25749920/247391_WOYD_PHOTO__CVirginia_1.jpg', '2024-11-23 14:00:00', 'Kylie Robison is The Verges senior reporter covering artificial intelligence. Previously, she worked at Fortune, where she covered Twitter; before that, she covered software developer culture (a beat… [+4068 chars]', 'technology'),
(66, NULL, 'The Verge', 'Nathan Edwards', 'The iMac M4 wasn’t built for this world - The Verge', 'The M4 iMac is a beautiful object and a good computer, and it’s still the only Mac that comes in actual colors. But otherwise, it’s the same machine as it was in 2023, and it’s substantially the same as it was back in 2021. So who is the M4 iMac for, exactly?', 'https://www.theverge.com/24303351/apple-imac-m4-review-expensive-beautiful-niche', 'https://cdn.vox-cdn.com/thumbor/iMSeehIHVUQFMChAhbwnG0T3MPE=/0x0:2709x1800/1200x628/filters:focal(1180x846:1181x847)/cdn.vox-cdn.com/uploads/chorus_asset/file/25729619/247382_Apple_iMac_M4_NEdwards_0005.jpg', '2024-11-23 15:15:00', 'Still beautiful. Still good. Still the wrong form factor for basically everybody.\r\nByNathan Edwards, a senior reviews editor who\'s been testing tech since 2007. Previously at Wirecutter and MaximumPC… [+12093 chars]', 'technology');
