(67, NULL, 'Forbes', 'Zak Doffman', 'Google Play Store Warning—Do Not Install These Free Apps - Forbes', 'You should delete these apps from your phone—here’s what you need to know.', 'https://www.forbes.com/sites/zakdoffman/2024/11/23/google-play-store-warning-do-not-install-these-free-apps/', 'https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/914596234/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&crop=2535,1624,x262,y579,safe&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds', '2024-11-23 13:43:57', 'New warning for millions of Play Store users.\r\nNurPhoto via Getty Images\r\nGoogle is on a mission to enhance security for Android users, narrowing the infamous gap to Apples more secure, more private … [+6196 chars]', 'technology'),
(68, NULL, 'Reuters', 'Reuters', 'Canada PM Trudeau visits Florida to meet with Trump amid tariff threat - Reuters Canada', 'Trudeau this week pledged to stay united against Trump\'s tariffs threat.', 'https://www.reuters.com/world/americas/canada-pm-trudeau-meet-with-trump-friday-florida-globe-mail-says-2024-11-29/', 'https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/WHOGIU7GAJIU3BD2APQ6WPR32A.jpg?auth=68fc45cd54c3d79583171a4197f3360ad2e53033b8aeb840e5f82996bd889ebe&height=1005&width=1920&quality=80&smart=true', '2024-11-30 07:27:00', 'No content available', 'Uncategorized'),
(69, NULL, '13WHAM-TV', 'Marty Snyder and John Buonaugurio', 'Lake effect snow impacts areas west of Rochester this weekend - 13WHAM-TV', 'Rochester, NY (WHAM) - Lake effect snow will kick into gear over the upcoming weekend. But this time, the focus will remain away from the immediate Rochester ar', 'https://13wham.com/news/local/lake-effect-snow-impacts-areas-west-of-rochester-this-weekend', 'https://13wham.com/resources/media2/16x9/805/986/0x5/90/eb23ea49-cd95-4999-887f-d941200d0e25-LakeEffectSnowWarning.JPG', '2024-11-30 07:00:00', 'Rochester, NY (WHAM) - Lake effect snow will kick into gear over the upcoming weekend. But this time, the focus will remain away from the immediate Rochester area. But if you\'ll be travelling south o… [+1826 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(70, NULL, 'KSBW The Central Coast', 'Jack Orleans', 'Teacher dies of rabies after bat bite - KSBW Monterey', 'A teacher working in Central California contracted rabies after a bat bite in her classroom.', 'https://www.ksbw.com/article/california-teacher-dies-california-rabies-after-bat-bite/63054652', 'https://kubrick.htvapps.com/htv-prod-media.s3.amazonaws.com/images/gettyimages-611228474-674a4e9c24d7c.jpg?crop=1.00xw:0.846xh;0,0.130xh&resize=1200:*', '2024-11-30 06:28:00', 'SALINAS, Calif. —An art teacher at Bryant Middle School in southern Merced County, died last week of rabies.\r\nIt\'s presumed Leah Seneng got rabies from a bat that had entered her classroom.\r\nSeneng t… [+381 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(71, NULL, 'CBS Sports', '', 'College Football Playoff Rankings: Oregon holds on top, Georgia rejoins top five, Alabama in projected field - CBS Sports', 'The fifth top 25 rankings of the 2024 season have arrived from the CFP Selection Committee', 'https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/college-football-playoff-rankings-oregon-holds-on-top-georgia-rejoins-top-five-alabama-in-projected-field/', 'https://sportshub.cbsistatic.com/i/r/2024/12/04/65a2b541-50c8-4aa8-b5ca-09dd606b6e0d/thumbnail/1200x675/25f6a08543b1c7346223b6f6d71dd527/graphic-cfpr5.png', '2024-12-04 05:43:00', 'The fifth and penultimate edition of the College Football Playoff Rankings were released Tuesday night with undefeated Oregon maintaining its spot at No. 1 as has been the case in every set of rankin… [+5220 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
