(73, NULL, 'CNN', 'Alejandra Jaramillo, Jack Forrest', 'Trump’s pick for DEA administrator withdraws from consideration - CNN', 'Chad Chronister, a Florida sheriff, has withdrawn from consideration as President-elect Donald Trump’s pick to lead the Drug Enforcement Administration, he announced on Tuesday.', 'https://www.cnn.com/2024/12/03/politics/chad-chronister-trump-dea-withdraws/index.html', 'https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/ap21222524035041.jpg?c=16x9&q=w_800,c_fill', '2024-12-04 05:17:00', 'Chad Chronister, a Florida sheriff, has withdrawn from consideration as President-elect Donald Trumps pick to lead the Drug Enforcement Administration, he announced on Tuesday.\r\nOver the past several… [+2215 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(74, NULL, 'Wired', 'Steven Levy', 'Tim Cook Wants Apple to Literally Save Your Life - WIRED', 'Much as the CEO seems awestruck by AI and his just-released Apple Intelligence, he’s more convinced that the tech giant’s health apps will define the company’s legacy.', 'https://www.wired.com/story/big-interview-tim-cook-wants-apple-to-literally-save-your-life/', 'https://media.wired.com/photos/6746346f7249ca1c03468834/191:100/w_1280,c_limit/Tim_Cook_10723_01_0014.jpg', '2024-12-04 13:30:00', 'Every time I visit the Apple Park campus, my mind flashes to a tour I took months before construction was finished, when there was dust on the terrazzo floors and mud where lush vegetation now flouri… [+4125 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(75, NULL, 'CBS Sports', '', 'College Football Playoff Rankings reaction: SEC love prevails again as Alabama sits ahead of Miami in top 25 - CBS Sports', 'Stop me if you\'ve heard this one before: Alabama is ranked ahead of an ACC team with fewer losses', 'https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/college-football-playoff-rankings-reaction-sec-love-prevails-again-as-alabama-sits-ahead-of-miami-in-top-25/', 'https://sportshub.cbsistatic.com/i/r/2024/11/24/fe35dd66-30bf-4b0b-908b-5bedf5bdff54/thumbnail/1200x675/0a3e0dfc3c260aa3ac123632bc36b8b3/alabamakalendeboermilroe.jpg', '2024-12-04 12:50:00', 'The ACC branding issues struck again. And the SEC again got the benefit of the doubt.\r\nSame as it ever was, right?\r\nThat was the sentiment emanating from ACC Country Tuesday after the College Footbal… [+5796 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(76, NULL, 'Reuters', 'Gram Slattery, Jonathan Landay', 'Trump\'s plan for Ukraine comes into focus: Territorial concessions but NATO off the table - Reuters', 'Advisers to Donald Trump publicly and privately are floating proposals to end the Ukraine war that would cede large parts of the country to Russia for the foreseeable future.', 'https://www.reuters.com/world/trumps-plan-ukraine-comes-into-focus-territorial-concessions-nato-off-table-2024-12-04/', 'https://www.reuters.com/resizer/v2/INNKBQT22NODFI4YRLYAFEXWPY.jpg?auth=4d5ef8eca713b0104314ba759e0d3b1d5b0a8f64d2735972763626eeba37af21&height=1005&width=1920&quality=80&smart=true', '2024-12-04 12:16:00', 'No content available', 'Uncategorized'),
(77, NULL, 'Financial Times', 'Nikou Asgari', 'Bitcoin hits $100,000 as Trump era hopes grow - Financial Times', 'Cryptocurrency has climbed more than 40% since US election on bets president-elect will bring in pro-crypto regulation', 'https://www.ft.com/content/f8db431e-57f9-4b43-8873-263101d070a5', 'https://www.ft.com/__origami/service/image/v2/images/raw/https%3A%2F%2Fd1e00ek4ebabms.cloudfront.net%2Fproduction%2F622aa254-6aeb-44a5-b66b-1c7e2ab04972.jpg?source=next-barrier-page', '2024-12-05 09:28:13', 'Try unlimited access\r\nOnly $1 for 4 weeks\r\nThen $75 per month.\r\nComplete digital access to quality FT journalism on any device. \r\nCancel anytime during your trial.', 'Uncategorized'),
(78, NULL, 'ESPN', 'Anonymous', 'Unranked Creighton storms past No. 1 Kansas - ESPN', 'Pop Isaacs helped unranked Creighton upset No. 1 Kansas 76-63 on Wednesday night, scoring a season-high 27 points and matching his career high with six 3-pointers.', 'https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/42786110/creighton-too-much-kansas-nation-no-1-team-falls', 'https://a1.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2024%2F1205%2Fr1423799_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg', '2024-12-05 09:24:00', 'OMAHA, Neb. -- Pop Isaacs helped unranked Creighton upset No. 1 Kansas 76-63 on Wednesday night, scoring a season-high 27 points and matching his career high with six 3-pointers.\r\nKansas cut a 13-poi… [+1598 chars]', 'Uncategorized'),
(79, NULL, 'CNN', 'Liam Reilly', 'Jeff Bezos says he will try to talk Trump out of idea that the news media is an ‘enemy’ - CNN', 'Despite feuding with Trump during his last administration, Bezos said he was “very optimistic” about a second Trump administration and suggested he even wants to help the incoming president.', 'https://www.cnn.com/2024/12/04/media/jeff-bezos-donald-trump-media-enemy/index.html', 'https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/gettyimages-2188281047.jpg?c=16x9&q=w_800,c_fill', '2024-12-05 08:54:00', 'Jeff Bezos hopes Donald Trump has changed.\r\nSpeaking at The New York Times DealBook Summit on Wednesday, the billionaire Amazon founder and Washington Post owner said he hopes that a second Trump adm… [+4142 chars]', 'Uncategorized');
